{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/747282-spirit-and-locus-in-one","id":747282,"title":"Spirit and Locus in one","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-01T13:08:47-08:00","id":747282,"title":"Spirit and Locus in one","content":"I have a question on interpreting the ephemera rules. <b>What is the status on the Spirit that is also the Loci?</b> Say we architectual monument representing some event - like signing the <i>Declaration of Independence</i>or <i>End of World War 2</i>. Those places gather large quantities of Essence connected to their ideas so Loci could be generated. But on the other hand those things should generate high Rank spirit of those concepts. <b>Could the Locus and Spirit be the same being, at least in the Shadow?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-02T01:45:31-08:00","id":748659,"title":"","content":"They can. That sort of spirits are usually immobile, it's locus generates it's essence daily and it always gets first dibs to it. There's an example of a rank 5 Sequoia spirit with a rank 5 locus around it in the 94th page of Territories.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#231F20\"><span style=\"font-family:Goudy\">Great Sequoia is a spirit as well as a locus, and some say he\u2019s actually the first tree-spirit ever born. As the years rolled by and his power grew, he changed in form to become as the sequoias are, magnificent and tall. Since his locus is bound to a spirit instead of a place, his locus is highly protected, and thus not freely accessible. Many spirits would like to control him, of course, but when an Incarna says \u201cno\u201d there\u2019s not much you can do about it. Great Sequoia will share his Essence with those he deems worthy, but that\u2019s a fairly select bunch; fewer than a dozen spirits receive his blessing each generation, and, while Uratha packs have managed to gain his favor in the past, they are few and far between.</span></span> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":576,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","user":"Ephsy","date":". 11-02-2015, 04:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-02T02:07:56-08:00","id":748709,"title":"","content":"I was thinknig about this topic when listening in <b>Broken Diamond</b> about Abraham Linoclon statue being both Locus and physical representation of local spirit court ruler.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}